<title>HUNGARY: INDICATORS - HUNGARY - UPDATED MAY 15.</title>
<headline>INDICATORS - HUNGARY - UPDATED MAY 15.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The latest indicators:</p>
<p> GDP (prelim. pct)    1996 +1.0pct (Q4 3.0 yr/yr Q3 +1.0 yr/yr)</p>
<p> CPI (pct)		April +1.4m/m +18.6y/y (March +1.9 +18.8)</p>
<p> PPI (pct)		March +1.5m/m +21.8yr/yr (Feb +2.1 +22.5)</p>
<p>Industry output(pct) March -8.6m/m +3.3 yr/yr  (Feb +2.4 +6.8)</p>
<p> Current account	Jan -$300 mln	 (Jan-Dec -$1.678 bln)</p>
